 and repair. Must have the ability to be on-call and able to respond to emergency situations in a time... View Details Bookmark TELECOM SPECIALIST I/II/III Connect - OIT Supervisory Technical External 09/08/2026 Responsible for administrative and technical planning for services provided by CMU sub-divisions Unified Communications, OIT and CONNECT/OIT. Duties include programming of a variety of complex communication and security services and other departmental operations and special projects, as assigned. Duties also include providing a high-level customer service experience to all constituents, mainten... View Details Bookmark INSTALL REPAIR TECH I/II - OIT Telecommunication Services-OIT Supervisory Technical External Responsible for installation, removal, rearrangement and maintenance on a variety of complex communication and security equipment. May repair and/or add to the University’s switch and database. View Details Bookmark PHYSICS/MACHINE SHOP TECHNICIAN II Physics Supervisory Technical 4 External Responsible for setting up and disassembling instructional laboratories, repairs and maintains laboratory equipment, controls departmental supply and equipment inventory, uses machine and wood shop techniques to fabricate and/or modify instructional and research equipment. View Details Bookmark Staff postings - Human Resources | Contact HR | (989)774-2010 | 109 Rowe Faculty postings - Faculty Personnel Services | Contact FPS | (989)774-3368 | 308 Warriner CMU is an Equal Opportunity Employer and institution.  CMU does not discriminate against persons based on age, color, disability, ethnicity, familial status, gender, gender expression, gender identity, genetic information, height, marital status, national origin, political persuasion, pregnancy, childbirth or related medical conditions, race, religion, sex, sex-based stereotypes, sexual orientation, transgender status, veteran status, or weight. Copyright © Central Michigan University, Mount Pleasant, Mich. 48859 |