ATOR Utility Operations Service Maintenance 11 External Performs skilled work in the operation and maintenance of high pressure steam boilers, steam absorption and centrifugal chillers, air conditioning cooling towers, steam, diesel and gas turbine driven generators, air compressors, pumps, and related work as required. View Details Bookmark ACADEMIC TUTOR/FACILITATOR TEMPORARY (PART-TIME) TRIO PROGRAMS - DETROIT Temporary Staff External Provides academic assistance to students in all academic areas and workshop facilitation as needed. Tutors work with TRIO Detroit Upward Bound and Educational Talent Search programs in Southwest and Northwest, Detroit within our target schools. View Details Bookmark TECHNICIAN TEMPORARY (PART-TIME) Various Temporary Staff External Temporary technician positions. No benefits. CMU occasionally has temporary technician positions available in various departments. Duties and responsibilities vary by department but primarily require specialized knowledge, applied scientific or technical skills. Responsibilities may include laboratory support, technical assistance for researchers or the library, medical billing/coding, technica... View Details Bookmark ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICE ASSISTANT TEMPORARY (PART-TIME) Various Temporary Staff External Part-time temporary administrative office assistant positions. No benefits. CMU occasionally has temporary administrative office assistant positions available in various departments. Duties and responsibilities vary by department but are primarily focused on providing secretarial support for specific departments. Responsibilities may include scheduling meetings, answering the phone, drafting co... View Details Bookmark PROFESSIONAL STAFF TEMPORARY (PART-TIME) Various Temporary Staff External Temporary professional positions. No benefits. CMU occasionally has temporary professional positions available in various departments. Most of these positions require a bachelor’s degree. Duties and responsibilities vary by department but include work requiring consistent exercise of discretion or judgement generally using advanced knowledge. Work may also be directly related to general busines... View Details Bookmark X-ray Studies of Quantum Materials Postdoctoral Research Fellow Department of Physics Postdoctoral Research Fellow External A postdoctoral position is available starting February 1, 2026, in the Physics Department at Central Michigan University. We are seeking an enthusiastic scientist to work in the field of structural characterization of quantum materials using x-ray scattering techniques and structure modeling. View Details Bookmark TEMPORARY MiCAREER MENTOR (PART-TIME) Teacher & Special Education Temporary Staff 00 External MiCAREER Mentors are experienced educators who guide candidates through the educator credentialing process while fostering professional growth and confidence. Mentors play a vital role in addressing the teacher shortage by supporting candidates’ unique needs and strengthening school communities. View Details Bookmark CHP STANDARDIZED PATIENT TEMPORARY (PART-TIME) The HH & GA Dow College of Health Prof IPEP Center Temporary Staff 00 External Standardized patient simulation involves the use of individuals trained to portray the roles of patients, family members or others to allow students the opportunity to develop, practice and enhance their interviewing skills, communication skills, physical exam/evaluations, and history taking techniques. Students participate in multiple standardized patient exercises throughout their healthcare ... View Details Bookmark GYNECOLOGICAL TEACHING ASSOCIATE (GTA) TEMPORARY (PART-TIME) College of Medicine Temporary Staff 00 External In-house training for females to teach the sensitive exam, assess and provide feedback to learners about accurate pelvic, and/or breast examination techniques. The GTA uses their body to guide medical students and physician assistant students through the entire process of performing 